# Lab trade-offs documented in FIDELITY.md — not production posture.
# trivy config still fails on real issues (e.g. 0.0.0.0/0 ingress).

# ALB listener is HTTP because nginx carries real traffic on LocalStack; ALB is IaC-only.
AVD-AWS-0054

# EC2 egress must reach Aiven MySQL (external SaaS) and apt for nginx at boot.
AVD-AWS-0104

# root_block_device is a dynamic block omitted when skip_root_block_device=true
# (LocalStack DescribeImages bug — FIDELITY.md §6). Trivy does not evaluate
# dynamic blocks, so it always reports unencrypted even when encrypted=true is
# declared for the non-skipped path.
AVD-AWS-0131
